{"id":"vod_sn_37227","vodId":"37227","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"新 咕噜咕噜魔法阵","name_cn":"新 咕噜咕噜魔法阵","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b800ed25a58410107485453c548ce0d3.jpg"},"summary":"《咕噜咕噜魔法阵》讲述了一个这样的故事：在吉姆吉姆大陆上的一个小村庄吉米拉村，有一天，国王颁布了勇者召集令悬赏，如果有人能够消灭魔王将会得到五万R并且能够成为哥达国的王子。仁杰的父亲发现了召集令，为此训练他的儿子、强迫儿子成为勇者踏上旅程。吉米拉村有着旅行前不得不去拜访 魔法婆婆的规则，按照这个规则，仁杰到达了魔法婆婆的家，勇者被命令和能够使用咕噜咕噜魔法的米古米古族人歌莉一起踏上旅程。然后被国王认同是勇者的仁杰以打倒企图征服世界的魔王纪力而和歌莉开始了旅程。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A1aWevCerJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rwcUVGD3Xu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x4W1MRUf281/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SYthjFGdjq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F3TbFDiN9k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nMJZ6cmW6X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5SYA2u97p11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kA0mX0LRXS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ECGmctJNNn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cVG0KWTkSt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UByw8pYCHB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uZTBefjYLT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kgRn3uwjtz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nt264rJhXF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eFwfUzQ